                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is one of those cases where I wish Steam had a \"mixed\" option. \n\nThere's a good foundation here but there's so many little frustrating things that ultimately keep it from being a great game. I like that the ship has a sense of weight to it instead of zipping around. Unfortunately the enemies don't seem to have that same sense of weight and have no issues completely zooming around you. The whole game is like that unfortunately, where there'll be something cool but then it's undermined by some issue. I bet wish some more updates this'd easily be a real gem.",
